  "bodyHash": "e800758929a861a2",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>一款简单小巧的 Minecraft 模组，新增了 16 种染色蛋装饰。</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1160/191/2025-04-da.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">这些彩色的蛋可以像 Minecraft 中的蜡烛一样放置——每个方块上可放置 1 到 4 个。</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1160/753/egg-1-4.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"225\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">制作非常简单，只需将普通蛋与你选择的任意颜色的染料组合即可：</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/1160/193/310/172/2025-04-17_03.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">在较新版本中，你还可以使用<strong>棕色</strong>和<strong>蓝色</strong>生态群系变体蛋进行合成：</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1329/841/screenshot-2025-09-20-020756-png.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1329/842/screenshot-2025-09-20-020812-png.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p>你可以自由地将此模组包含在你的整合包中。</p>\n<p>由&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/leonxkingx/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Leonxkingx</a>&nbsp;与&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/madebysanny/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MadeBySanny</a>&nbsp;制作</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
